{"language_code": "eng", "language_probability": 0.966927707195282, "text": "This is the one travel bag every guy should own. It's from a brand called Velantra, and it fixed what's wrong with almost every bag at this price. Usually, you're picking between a four hundred dollar bag you're scared to actually use or a cheap one that says premium materials in the listing and starts peeling by the second trip. Spoiler, that's plastic. The Velantra Weekender is full-grain leather over woven canvas. The walls are structured, so you pack it like a suitcase, not a duffel. There's a leather slip pocket inside and no logos anywhere on it. It holds three days, keeps its shape packed full or empty, and slides right into the overhead bin. A hundred and sixty bucks. Stop buying bags you have to replace. It's the Eleanor Weekender at velantrafashion.com.", "words": [{"text": "This", "start": 0.099, "end": 0.259, "type": "word", "logprob": -6.615896563744172e-05}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.259, "end": 0.319, "type": "spacing", "logprob": 0.0}, {"text": "is", "start": 0.319, "end": 0.439, "type": "word", "logprob": 0.0}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.439, "end": 0.5, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"text": "the", "start": 0.5, "end": 0.579, "type": "word", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.579, "end": 0.62, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"text": "one", "start": 0.62, "end": 0.779, "type": "word", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.779, "end": 0.819, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"text": "travel", "start": 0.819, "end": 1.1, "type": "word", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"text": " ", "start": 1.1, "end": 1.22, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"text": "bag", "start": 1.22, "end": 1.539, "type": "word", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"text": " ", "start": 1.539, "end": 1.62, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, 